{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Hey Caroline! Last night was amazing! We celebrated my daughter's birthday with a concert surrounded by music, joy and the warm summer breeze. Seeing my kids' smiles was so awesome, and I'm so thankful for our special moments together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-2b0763910b9b3e810d653513", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.098231+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2b0763910b9b3e810d653513", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2b0763910b9b3e810d653513", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, sounds wonderful! Your love for your kids is so awesome. What concert was it? The advocacy event was a cool experience - so much love and support, amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-3f527272875de8752cee2d81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.132341+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f527272875de8752cee2d81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f527272875de8752cee2d81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! It was Matt Patterson, he is so talented! His voice and songs were amazing. What's up with you? Anything interesting going on?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-a58b36689e164706f2a19885", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.150540+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a58b36689e164706f2a19885", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a58b36689e164706f2a19885", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, Mel, glad you had a blast at the concert. A lot's happened since we talked. I went to a pride parade last Friday and it was awesome - so much energy and love everywhere. Really made me proud and reminded me how important it is to keep standing up for equality."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-bcc63696d4ce66a69347c7a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.171425+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bcc63696d4ce66a69347c7a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bcc63696d4ce66a69347c7a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, that's awesome! How did it feel being part of that community?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-edf818c3bbf80ee4e73bab2e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.197952+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "edf818c3bbf80ee4e73bab2e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "edf818c3bbf80ee4e73bab2e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: It was so inspiring, Mel! Check out the crowd. People of all kinds celebrating love and acceptance - it really pushed me to keep fighting for LGBTQ rights."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-b0aa6f1b6970ccf36b4be769", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.212665+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b0aa6f1b6970ccf36b4be769", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b0aa6f1b6970ccf36b4be769", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That sounds awesome. This pic's from last night - looks like everyone was having a blast! Reminds me it's important to cultivate a loving and accepting environment for our kids. How do you stay inclusive in your work as an artist?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-08664d730f2e0a3e7b70a4dc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.234492+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "08664d730f2e0a3e7b70a4dc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "08664d730f2e0a3e7b70a4dc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That pic is cool! Representing inclusivity and diversity in my art is important to me. I also use it to speak up for the LGBTQ+ community and push for acceptance. Here's a recent painting!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-81178a3e4699ea00ee1864d9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.257269+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "81178a3e4699ea00ee1864d9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "81178a3e4699ea00ee1864d9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, that rocks! What's the main idea of your art?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-eec90a6bda7a7eee4c469c0c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.277786+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eec90a6bda7a7eee4c469c0c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eec90a6bda7a7eee4c469c0c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: My art is about expressing my trans experience. It's my way of showing my story and helping people understand the trans community."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-9c6e19342c648998cf9c3770", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.301922+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c6e19342c648998cf9c3770", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c6e19342c648998cf9c3770", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Your art's amazing, Caroline. I love how you use it to tell your stories and teach people about trans folks. I'd love to see another painting of yours!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-c032f187382b0b8fd7288752", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.320050+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c032f187382b0b8fd7288752", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c032f187382b0b8fd7288752", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. Here's one- 'Embracing Identity' is all about finding comfort and love in being yourself. The woman in the painting stands for the journey of acceptance. My aim was to show warmth, love and self-acceptance."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-6fe083de3b9772b182c6bbfe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.343819+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6fe083de3b9772b182c6bbfe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6fe083de3b9772b182c6bbfe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline, that's gorgeous! I love the self-acceptance and love theme. How does art help you with your self-discovery and acceptance journey?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-950f901254ac40a4f870fe8c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.366012+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "950f901254ac40a4f870fe8c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "950f901254ac40a4f870fe8c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Art's allowed me to explore my transition and my changing body. It's been a great way to work through stuff I'm going through. I love that it teaches me to accept the beauty of imperfections."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-d9bd7b83b63b419c129896f0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.385991+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d9bd7b83b63b419c129896f0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d9bd7b83b63b419c129896f0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline, that's so cool! Art can be so healing and a way to really connect with who you are. It's awesome that beauty can be found in the imperfections. We're all individual and wonderfully imperfect. Thanks for sharing it with me!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-3f584753396607608310e3e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.406507+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f584753396607608310e3e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f584753396607608310e3e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. It means a lot to share this with you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-72e8c59c3c03d8048a6f3bc9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.428967+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "72e8c59c3c03d8048a6f3bc9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "72e8c59c3c03d8048a6f3bc9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Great chatting with you! Feel free to reach out any time."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-26/session_11-5fbd32ccb5d0e15fbe1cb902", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T13:56:25.447664+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5fbd32ccb5d0e15fbe1cb902", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5fbd32ccb5d0e15fbe1cb902", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
